# OxyKit.Mail agent defaults

- Start from `AGENTS.md`. Public MIT core: [oxykit-dev/OxyKit.Mail](https://github.com/oxykit-dev/OxyKit.Mail).
- Layout: `src/` + `tests/` + `hoppscotch/` (`OxyKit.Mail.slnx`).
- Pure VSA features: `Identity`, `ApiKeys`, `Email`, `Dashboard` under `src/OxyKit.Mail/Features/`.
- Flat feature files; subfolders only `Services/` and `Configuration/`.
- Auth: trust `Roles()` / schemes in `Configure()`; dual JWT + `X-Api-Key`; use `AppRoles.*`.
- Tests are **xUnit** under `tests/OxyKit.Mail.Tests/`. Runtime **http://localhost:5026** + Scalar at `/scalar`.
- After endpoint/config changes: update Hoppscotch / `ENVIRONMENT_SETTINGS.md` / `CHANGELOG.md` as applicable.
- Frontend work belongs in `../oxykit-mail-web`.
